@startuml
' !theme crayon

title Centralized vs. Decentralized Networks

rectangle "Centralized Network" as centralized
rectangle "Decentralized Network" as decentralized

' Centralized Network details
centralized -- "Server"
note top of centralized : "Single Point of Failure"
note bottom of centralized : "Controlled by a Single Authority"

' Decentralized Network details
decentralized -- "Node 1"
decentralized -- "Node 2"
decentralized -- "Node 3"
note top of decentralized : "No Single Point of Failure"
note bottom of decentralized : "Distributed Control"

' Connecting the Networks for comparison
note left: "Traditional Architecture"
note right: "Modern Approach"

@endum